    /// <summary>Wipe the paired device and force a clean re-pairing — <c>POST /instances/{id}/clear-session</c>.</summary>
    /// <remarks>Deletes the stored WhatsApp device credential for this number, not just its reference. Use it when `connect` will not produce a QR code, or when pairing is stuck in an inconsistent state — a plain `logout` leaves the old device behind. The next `connect` pairs from scratch. Destructive and irreversible: the number goes offline and must be paired again by scanning a QR code. It is idempotent and safe to retry.</remarks>
    /// <param name="id"><c>id</c> (caminho). Obrigatório. Instance ID (UUID).</param>
